# Local Test-Comp workspace: benchmark preparation, paper material and run
# artifacts. Kept out of the repository deliberately. The Juliet evaluation
# harness that used to live under test-comp2026/simulation/ now sits in
# tests/juliet/, next to tests/castle/, so the two benchmark harnesses share
# one layout and neither depends on this directory.
